OL,3,GNEWSASchool milestone 'means
OL,4,Aeverything', says mum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a young boy who endured
OL,7,F2,000 medical procedures and 10 blood
OL,8,Ftransfusions says the milestone of
OL,9,Fstarting secondary school this year
OL,10,F"means everything".
OL,12,FSeb, 11, from Tring in Hertfordshire,
OL,13,Fsuffered repeated infections, extreme
OL,14,Ftiredness and weight loss before he was
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with lymphoblastic lymphoma,
OL,16,Fa blood cancer, in 2019.
OL,18,FClaire Boulter said their "world was
OL,19,Fturned upside down" when a 11cm mass
OL,20,Fwas discovered in her son's chest by
OL,21,Fdoctors at Stoke Mandeville Hospital in
OL,22,FAylesbury, Buckinghamshire.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
