OL,3,GNEWSASchool milestone 'means
OL,4,Aeverything', says mum
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Seeing your child start secondary
OL,7,Fschool is an ordinary milestone most
OL,8,Ffamilies take for granted, but for us
OL,9,Fit means everything," she added.
